    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. These Rules are the Income Tax (Meaning of “Prescribed Property” in Section 13X(6)) Rules 2022 and are deemed to have come into operation on 16 November 2021."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H2309-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Meaning of “prescribed property”"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. For the purposes of section 13X(5A) of the Act, “prescribed property” is any non-residential property."
   }
  }
